summary:
  The handoff every other start goes through leaves a paused episode
  standing.

history:
  2026.44 lets a pause keep an episode or a My Music file, and a Play that
  names nothing brings it back. That memory has to end with the first thing
  chosen after it: a station picked by hand, a search result, another file,
  the wake-up. All of them pass _podHandoff before anything can fail, so the
  drop sits there. Without it the station is stopped, Play is pressed, and
  the episode from before comes on in its place.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
          _pausedFile = null;

replace:
          _pausedFile = _pausedFile;

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_the_transport_words_go_through_one_door_and_a_pause_keeps_its_file.
  tests/qml/tst_transportroads.qml::test_a_station_picked_by_hand_ends_the_pause_for_good
  walks the same road around a copy of these lines. Line-neutral.
